    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Finnish Cottage 8, a classic summer cottage in the woods so peaceful you\u2019d never want to leave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297630/extras/f699cb5eaee393f85302ea863e758d60.poster.avif?t=1741990563\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297630/extras/f699cb5eaee393f85302ea863e758d60.webm?t=1741990563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297630/extras/f699cb5eaee393f85302ea863e758d60.mp4?t=1741990563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finnish Cottage 8 is a walking simulator set in a m\u00f6kki (summer cottage), a beloved staple of Finnish summer life. Equipped with an obligatory sauna and a classic Finnish weather forecast radio program, this game will transport you to the tranquility of summer in the Land of A Thousand Lakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297630/extras/982f0f8fe46dd174e8f57cbc0f06b0dd.avif?t=1741990563\" data-has-big width=800 height=640 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in this cottage, something sinister stirs where your eyes don't reach.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe carefully and you may find your way out.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bad news is, you are not the first to attempt an escape...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The good news is, you are not the first to attempt an escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret organisation has been investigating this cottage, and their efforts left behind certain convenient tools. This\u00a0<strong>laptop</strong> will help you identify which loop you are in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297630/extras/0a68af7ddc6ba0e1c1484f312889e9fb.avif?t=1741990563\" width=614 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you <strong>see</strong> an anomaly, leave through the <strong>back door</strong>\u00a0(marked with &quot;Anomalies&quot; tape).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you <strong>don\u2019t see</strong> an anomaly, leave through the <strong>front door</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are right, the <strong>loop number goes up by 1</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are wrong, you\u2019ll return to <strong>Loop 0</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the number reaches 8, the cottage may let you go....</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Average Play time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 - 60 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Languages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes audio in English and Finnish, but understanding of the latter is not required for playing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtitles are available in English, Finnish, Russian, Ukrainian, Japanese, Chinese (Simplified), Spanish.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Finnish Cottage 8, a classic summer cottage in the woods so peaceful you\u2019d never want to leave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297630/extras/f699cb5eaee393f85302ea863e758d60.poster.avif?t=1741990563\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297630/extras/f699cb5eaee393f85302ea863e758d60.webm?t=1741990563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297630/extras/f699cb5eaee393f85302ea863e758d60.mp4?t=1741990563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finnish Cottage 8 is a walking simulator set in a m\u00f6kki (summer cottage), a beloved staple of Finnish summer life. Equipped with an obligatory sauna and a classic Finnish weather forecast radio program, this game will transport you to the tranquility of summer in the Land of A Thousand Lakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297630/extras/982f0f8fe46dd174e8f57cbc0f06b0dd.avif?t=1741990563\" data-has-big width=800 height=640 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in this cottage, something sinister stirs where your eyes don't reach.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe carefully and you may find your way out.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bad news is, you are not the first to attempt an escape...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The good news is, you are not the first to attempt an escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A secret organisation has been investigating this cottage, and their efforts left behind certain convenient tools. This\u00a0<strong>laptop</strong> will help you identify which loop you are in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297630/extras/0a68af7ddc6ba0e1c1484f312889e9fb.avif?t=1741990563\" width=614 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you <strong>see</strong> an anomaly, leave through the <strong>back door</strong>\u00a0(marked with &quot;Anomalies&quot; tape).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you <strong>don\u2019t see</strong> an anomaly, leave through the <strong>front door</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are right, the <strong>loop number goes up by 1</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are wrong, you\u2019ll return to <strong>Loop 0</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the number reaches 8, the cottage may let you go....</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Average Play time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 - 60 minutes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Languages</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes audio in English and Finnish, but understanding of the latter is not required for playing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtitles are available in English, Finnish, Russian, Ukrainian, Japanese, Chinese (Simplified), Spanish.\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "You've been trapped in a looping Finnish summer cottage. Use your observation and memory to find anomalies and make the right choice to escape the Finnish Cottage 8.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Finnish, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
